action "Delete old downloads"
plan  1 steps
plan  1 "Deleting old downloads…" inproc confirm optional alwayslog cat=cleanup
log   cleanup CHECK: Checked 2 items in ~/Downloads: 2 older than 30 days (oldest 30 days).
ask   "Delete 2 item(s) older than 30 days in ~/Downloads?\n\n  old.iso\n  old.zip" -> yes
step  1 running
out   1 [dry-run] would delete: old.iso
out   1 [dry-run] would delete: old.zip
step  1 ok
log   cleanup DRYRUN: Old downloads deleted
end   outcome=completed errs=0 skipped=0
